# Docker & deploy

- Pin base image tags; prefer Python 3.12+ for the Streamlit app.
- In Compose, set `OLLAMA_HOST=http://ollama:11434` (service name, not localhost).
- Self-host profile: `USE_DUMMY_GENERATOR=false`.
- Persist Ollama models via a named volume; document `ollama pull` in `docs/operators/running.md`.
- Do not bake secrets into images; use env files excluded from git.
- Expose Streamlit on 8501 for local Compose. Behind an existing reverse proxy, use `deploy/docker-compose.shared-edge.yml` so the proxy owns the public ports.
- Healthcheck Ollama before app depends on it when possible.
- Do not add a reverse proxy or invite service in this repo. Those stay with the proxy in front.

PRs and reviews follow the standard in `AGENTS.md`.
